        "qa_52": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "q": "How is the lift operated?",
            "a": "<p>With an ergonomic remote control, so you can raise and lower the platform from a safe distance.</p>"
          }
        },
        "qa_53": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "q": "What happens when it reaches the top?",
            "a": "<p>The automatic limit stop halts the lift by itself at the upper and lower end positions, so there's no over-travel.</p>"
          }
        },
        "qa_54": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "q": "Which safety features does Selo have?",
            "a": "<p>A precise braking system, automatic limit stops at the top and bottom, reinforced guard rails and a non-slip platform. Selo is for lifting materials only and is not approved for carrying people.</p>"
          }
        },
        "qa_55": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "q": "How do I set Selo up?",
            "a": "<p>Follow the set-up steps and safety instructions in the operating manual supplied with Selo. Always position the lift on firm, level ground before lifting.</p>"
          }
        },
        "qa_56": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "q": "What maintenance does Selo need?",
            "a": "<p>Inspect the steel cable, brake and limit stops regularly as described in the operating manual, and keep the platform clean and free of debris.</p>"
          }
        },
        "qa_57": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "q": "How long does delivery take?",
